        "text": "theorem physicalProfile_eq_profile (a : ℝ) {X η : ℝ} (hX : 0 < X)\n    (hη : η ∈ Icc (-1 : ℝ) 1) :\n    physicalProfile a X η = profile a (2 * (1 - η ^ 2) / X)"
